  "content_html": "<h2>Global news</h2> <p>Global markets showed mixed signals as traders navigated geopolitical tensions and awaited key economic data. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOLUE4QXJjenhzdy1DTVEtby1VRDU5TnozczNRWGM0SFVEWDVVelIwQ08xRVRyaVpVbWpuR2dKMzZaZG9vU0tqLUJWaVM2OFd5U2FkTUhfQ3hrczVIcVVVeldhNGRfajlrLUFrZWRpOVM2bFZSekxmT2NISmxqSDVmR1kyZkZ5VjZoT2liZFJmSm1sZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">World shares traded mixed after Wall Street gains</a>, while oil prices bounced higher amid ongoing negotiations over the Strait of Hormuz closure.</p> <p>The Iran-Oman talks over reopening the critical shipping route remain stalled, with <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPbXFfcVg2QVZTZE9DLUhxOGRXR2Nzc0cxVlZWVzJKbmwxaHpvTVNFMlUzdldodTl2ZzVvUjB4ZWtocm5keVdrYWU5ekduZzBfcXlvWGthNl9CV3BYTjlISXY5VTRjZmdwOU05UFN5SmsyX3N5MGQ2VjJDQzhPRno5T0laQnFFVmh2VDNWSTNfOXJrWGxBR09XTnhEQ3k2UmtKMGpMLVhHaHh6b1dzSVBmSQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Iran conditioning reopening on U.S. concessions</a>. Oil traders are pricing in potential breakthrough scenarios while remaining cautious about supply disruptions.</p> <p>U.S. futures edged higher as investors prepared for critical inflation data releases this week. <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">S&amp;P 500 futures inched higher</a> as markets grappled with Iran uncertainty and awaited fresh economic indicators.</p> <p>The Federal Reserve faces mounting scrutiny over its monetary policy approach. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE8teTJqbjhiWFJIbWJ2emRScjZZRzVZWF9NLXNVb2k4Q2g0NTFlZzdmSC1JQ2phc0F2X0RHMFBoRE9DRUdXZllqZGhPZ1dtS0xzWV9YNXByRlVMdFIxZERKTU5QcERtdm5PTFVRcXIteDJod0k?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kevin Warsh is reportedly rewiring Fed operations</a>, while <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPTGtZcUxST3BKd3FOQ2l3TDltSUlfQl82cGhRLU9XOHZNdHltaEFUM3RaMmNzdGRIQWJRSWR1c0VEUVJDYTVycVhRbVpTNjc4SFBFdUo2TnBHTWF0MjVIc0ZWb254Uzc4MXlkQnFORUd3d0RWT3VJdkpWMUJfTVNIOGtvUTNZVUVaUUVOYXRsQUtFeXZmbzRSOHNSWHRGT2FXaTFNNGNuZXFwVUs1T2JUUnpDWnM?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wall Street expresses bond market concerns</a> over Treasury Department policies.</p> <p>Corporate earnings continued to drive market sentiment. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPMm9DTDNMRjNDNG1PRzZnWF8zLXJMeURJM0NKdVNLMzVYbVVxNm9DVS13M1pNVDF0WVBUQ3M2SGZYM1JRb1BCR3lqYXFsdlpmb1RoSTRsSHc2NTh1eDAyQzBZN3djOFVuY28zQ0o1anpRekd3UG9DSlFKRnNPV1kxc2dadHZ4UXl4NTdTTDUxVmRkSEhQeUdJQV9sWVFQbmk5X0dYYWRUWC1NeWQ2Y3BYMXBoMVRlNlVyU2xFY09LM2lJZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Berkshire Hathaway's cash balances retreated</a> as Warren Buffett increased investments and share buybacks in Q2. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOQ0Q0eDN6S2MtSWdWVHNON1MwZm9LRldKWTYyczhOaFhnSXVjeTQ0N2xUdmFYSGNYYVh5c0dYbjJFVWJNenhwblpFYWJPVF9jUTZSNzlDVk4yZHprTFE3NFhyUEFDQW8yQ3l2X1NYYlUtODE2OG1kZ0lIdXRaa1RNcWFkUEVJZjVEWTFDb01Rbm9qbjIybGNTbE1oUkNjQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">JPMorgan strategists raised their S&amp;P 500 target</a> as AI capital expenditures show returns.</p> <p>The labor market showed concerning signs with <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wall Street assessing the surprise July jobs report negatively</a>, with employers increasingly reluctant to hire despite stock market gains.</p> <p>In housing markets, <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">America's hottest housing markets were identified</a>, showing regional variations in demand patterns.</p> <p>International developments included <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPZVE5VlVDck5nWFNvMW5IV0VlU0FNU3dWUFJLQVN6aDA5Rl9mbUEwRjZyY29xMUNqaVh1TktaUmI4ZzV4X1lMMUU3WG9LVlVRQ3hOcnItdF9yaTVOWHI0T3JFMWZ1eENqZU9tMGgybzFWd2VUanZ1bTFVaXQ2elNuSEMzdWhINUFNODBsQkwwRWdPWVJtWk1EbWVmWnlvMUNJMU55Nno0Rl9PVDBKSDNhajdIbGc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">U.A.E.'s Adnoc Gas planning over $8 billion in expansion</a> investments, while <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQdmZzeko4d25QY05HaHdrcFdqT0doLTREa0gwN3dYU3VDUUxXUkFna0J4MlQzMmxkZG1ZRFJvLWdjQnVYeFFGVUFrLW10dnpoR3d1RWNIYV96RjU5TFRfLWN5X3RJeHZOdWpGemNNQ1gtY0ZyNlYyNHhYSEdiRTlHUk5kZ2xyYWNQZFBGUjczejd0RG9uRHRUQ3NaSmhBaDItRzd1XzJpUDVTcV9WZmhBWWdB?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shein's IPO valuation is expected to fall short</a> of the $30 billion some investors targeted.</p> <p>Food safety concerns emerged with <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPLVlXVUx2cjdVR3F1MUNDVzlybnN1RW5UTXIyWG85RThOLUdFOU1JSTRBU1U1MnktX29JTzJSMmhBb0tSdkJiOGJBQ3FleWs5ckREaXQyOG5vb0ppRWxWRk1sSm1vYWw0c2M0b3hQTUpULWdHYlFFYTFwV1BwNnp4N2xXYzU4akRVMnc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Taylor Farms voluntarily recalling fresh jalapeños</a> over Salmonella concerns, while <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQbGxGVnFQZGo5czc2RVJBSlhnLXFOd0dlaWtma3UyTmlpZFdJUWw3a2dZY05Ea2dGZXVYZHZEUDlUZEZPVnNpQWFCZ08zTTQ3ek8zdTRYejJUZzd4V1Zfcncwci05bmVpZ0FZRkxKWGdnd2JDZW1QWU1MSEd0UkMzbjVsamhhVExCaFpsSTBkTHUyU0drd1NPd3NyblNZNjlzU0tzWm9JREI?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">families resort to drastic measures</a> to afford basic groceries amid persistent inflation pressures.</p> <h2>Brazilian news</h2> <p>Brazilian politics heated up with the first nationalized debate between São Paulo Governor Tarcísio de Freitas and Finance Minister Fernando Haddad. <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The debate covered data-driven discussions on PCC crime, Trump tariffs, and privatizations</a>.</p> <p>Presidential polling shows competitive dynamics ahead of 2030</p>"
